6. Keeping in view the fact that the respondent no.2 does not wish to pursue her complaint any further, which she states was filed out of some misunderstanding, and states that she has moved on in her life, and also keeping in view the guidelines issued by the Supreme Court in Kapil Gupta v.
State (NCT of Delhi), 2022 SCC OnLine SC 1030; Gian Singh v. State of Punjab, (2012) 10 SCC 303;
and Parbathai Aahir @ Parbatbhai Bimsinh Karmur & Ors. v. State of Gujarat & Ors., (2017) 9 SCC 641, I find that no useful purpose will be served in continuing with the proceedings emanating from the above-mentioned FIR.

